        "contact": null,
        "notes": "Read on 2026-11-10. Limits: no request count is limited ('There are no limits on concurrent requests'); characters are, per hour and by tier - F0 (free) 2,000,000 an hour, to be used evenly (about 33,300 a minute), S1 and multi-service 40,000,000, S2/C2 40,000,000, S3/C3 120,000,000, S4/C4 200,000,000; a request holds at most 1,000 texts and 50,000 characters (detection: 100 texts); a synchronous document at most 10 MB, 6,000,000 characters a minute. Out of quota: 429; a spent free trial: 403. Declared per tier in plans (f0 the default; s1, multi-service, s2, c2, s3, c3, s4, c4), counted in characters translated per subscription key; the factory's \"plan\" option names the resource's tier. Detection, dictionary and document translation are not counted (the page states no hourly figure for them; synchronous documents: 6,000,000 characters a minute on every tier). Data retention: text translation does not store customer data; document translation stores it while it works, then deletes it for good. Commercial use and attribution: the pages read do not state them, hence unknown and not required. The free tier's monthly amount was not read (only the hourly limits above)."
